# Normalise to LF in the repository, whatever the checkout platform does.
#
# CI regenerates test/vectors.json and fails on any diff. Without this, the
# file committed from a Windows checkout would differ from the one a Linux
# runner writes by line ending alone, and the build would fail for a reason
# that has nothing to do with the hashing rules.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
